      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi yaabara abantu abu yaabaire aine, yaataho abantu kuba abakuru b'engabo rukumi-rukumi n'aba igana-igana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.15.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 15:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Yaagaba engabo, ekicweka kimwe kya kashatu yaakiha Yoabu, ekindi yaakiha Abishai mwene Zeruiya, murumuna wa Yoabu, n'ekindi yaakiha Itaayi owa Gaasi. Omugabe yaagira abantu ati: Naanye ahabwangye niinyija kuhurura naimwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.21.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 21:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kwonka abantu baamugira bati: Iwe torikwija kuhurura; ahabw'okuba ku turaahungye, tibarikwija kutufaho; nangwa n'obu ekicweka kimwe kya kabiri ky'abantu baintu kyakufa, nabwo tibakaatufaho; ahakube iwe noingana n'abantu baitu kakumi; n'ahabw'ekyo haakiri ogume omu rurembo, otwoherereze ab'okutuha emikono. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omugabe yaabagira ati: Eki murikusiima nikyo ndaakore. Bwanyima omugabe yaayemerera aha irembo, engabo zoona nizishohora omu mitwe ya igana-igana na rukumi-rukumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.18.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 18:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Omugabe yaayehangangiriza Yoabu na Abishai na Itaayi ati: Mutwaze gye ogwo mwojo Abusalomu ahabwangye. Kandi abantu boona baahurira omugabe naayehanangiriza abakuru b'engabo ebya Abusalomu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
