              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "28:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi Abusalomu, obu yaabaire akihuriire, akatwara enyomyo, yaagibyara omu ruhanga rw'omugabe; ahabw'okuba akagira ati: Tiinyine mwana w'omwojo, ou bariijukiraho eiziina ryangye; kandi egyo nyomyo yaagyeyeterera; n'okuhitsya hati neekyetwa enyomo y'ekiijutsyo kya Abusalomu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.18"
            ]
