            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bwanyima Ahimaazi mwene Zadoki yaagira ati: ka nyirukye ngambire omugabe ag'aha rugamba, n'oku MUKAMA yaamuhoorera enzigu aha bazigu be. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoabu yaamugira ati: Otaza kugamba amakuru eri izooba, kureka ogagambe obundi. Kwonka eri izooba orekye kugagamba, ahabw'okuba omwana w'omugabe yaafa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoabu yaagira Omukuushi ati: Irooko ogyende, ogambire omugabe ebi waareeba. Atyo Omukuushi yainama omu maisho ga Yoabu, yairuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahimaazi mwene Zadoki yaagaruka yaagira Yoabu ati: Ninkweshengyereza, ka nyirukye nkurate oriya Mukuushi, oku biraabe bibekwo. Yoabu yaagira ati: Noirukibwa ki, mwana wangye, ka noomanya ku otakiheebwa bihembo ahabw'ago makuru? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.34.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bir 34:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Onu yaagira ati: Ekiraabe kyabaire kibe, naaza kugyenda. Yoabu ati: Iruka. Atyo Ahimaazi yairuka, yaatoora ogw'oruhita, yaatangayo Omukuushi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.23"
            ]
          }
        }
