                  "text": "2 Bag 9:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi Daudi akaba ashutami ahagati y'amarembo abiri; omurinzi yaatemba aha mutwe gw'eirembo, yaayemerera aha rugo rw'amabaare; ku yaanagire amaisho, yaareeba omuntu nairuka wenka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omurinzi yaayeta, yaagambira omugabe. Omugabe yaagira ati: ku araabe ari wenka, aine amakuru agu areetsire. Ogwo muntu yaija naayehuuta, yaahika haihi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima omurinzi yaareeba ondiijo mushaija nairuka; yaayeta omukumiirizi, yaamugira ati: Reeba ondiijo mushaija nairuka wenka. Omugabe yaagira ati: Nawe areetsire amakuru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omurinzi yaagira ati: Okundikureeba, okwiruka kw'oyebembeire nikushusha okwa Ahimaazi mwene Zadoki. Omugabe yaagira ati: Ava omushaija murungi, naija kureeta amakuru marungi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
